{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a demo version of the full game TEETH CUTTER</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this version, you will have access to two stories:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Father Martin Is Missing</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a private investigator looking for a lost father of a newly constructed church. Read his notes and investigate the area to find out what happened to him. Hear the sounds of God's breath.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Intruder</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a man who gets home from a long day and realizes that someone is inside his home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These will take you about 20 minutes to complete combined and will give a good idea of the atmosphere and story matter from the full experience.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4155370?t=1762633338","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4155370?t=1762633338","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155370/41ce7ce382a1cef06b470712f9100ed0faf175fb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762633338","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155370/41ce7ce382a1cef06b470712f9100ed0faf175fb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762633338","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Depictions of mental illness. Gun violence. Stylized blood and gore. Themes of religious trauma."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a demo version of the full game TEETH CUTTER</p><p class=\"bb_p